[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Going on Holiday]
[00:00.98]Lesson 83 | 第83课
[00:03.02]Going on holiday | 去度假
[00:05.89]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.56]Where did Sam go for his holiday this year? | 萨姆今年去哪里度假了？
[00:17.74]Hello, Sam. | 你好，萨姆。
[00:20.48]Come in. | 进来。
[00:22.35]Hi, Sam. | 嗨，萨姆。
[00:24.55]We're having lunch. | 我们正在吃午饭。
[00:26.30]Do you want to have lunch with us? | 你想和我们一起吃午饭吗？
[00:30.48]No, thank you, Tom. | 不用了，谢谢你，汤姆。
[00:33.04]I've already had lunch. | 我已经吃过午饭了。
[00:35.72]I had lunch at half past twelve. | 我十二点半吃午饭的。
[00:39.62]Have a cup of coffee then. | 那喝杯咖啡吧。
[00:42.82]I've just had a cup, thank you. | 我刚喝了一杯，谢谢。
[00:46.18]I had one after my lunch. | 我午饭后喝的。
[00:49.54]Let's go into the living room, Carol. | 凯罗尔，我们去客厅吧。
[00:53.36]We can have our coffee there. | 我们可以在那儿喝咖啡。
[00:56.84]Excuse the mess, Sam. | 萨姆，请原谅这儿有点乱。
[00:59.85]This room's very untidy. | 这房间太不整洁了。
[01:03.20]We're packing our suitcases. | 我们正在打包行李箱。
[01:06.13]We're going to leave tomorrow. | 我们明天要走了。
[01:09.54]Tom and I are going to have a holiday. | 汤姆和我要去度假了。
[01:13.99]Aren't you lucky! | 你们真幸运！
[01:17.46]When are you going to have a holiday, Sam? | 萨姆，你什么时候去度假？
[01:21.40]I don't know. | 我不知道。
[01:23.35]I've already had my holiday this year. | 我今年已经度过假了。
[01:27.60]Where did you go? | 你去哪儿了？
[01:29.98]I stayed at home! | 我待在家里！